---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Portfolio"
    description="Portfolio"
    withHeader={false}
    withFooter={false}
>
    <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Deni Susanto</h1>
        <p class="text-sm tracking-wide text-brand-foreground/70">
            A self-taught cybersecurity enthusiast from Indonesia.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <details class="par" open>
            <summary>Summary</summary>
            <div class="h-0 par:open-h-2xl">
                <p>
                    I'm a selft taught in tech, Cybersecurity and Linux
                    enthusiast.
                </p>
            </div>
        </details>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h2>Skills</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>python</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <p>
            i don't have work experience, only self learning through hands-on
            training
        </p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h2>Education</h2>
        <p>
            My latest education was SMAN 1 Campurdarat, graduated 2026. before
            that i go to SMPN 1 Tanggunggunung, and SDN 2 Kresikan.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <p>
            I don't think i have many project, mostly never done. but i guess i
            can say i have virtual homelab to learn by messing with things, also
            this pages should count, and maybe some command line tools as well.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h2>Certifications</h2>
        <p>
            I got Python certification from freecodecamp, introduction to
            cybersecurity from cisco networking academy. i think just that worth
            mentioning, i searched for free certificates only. i have many minor
            certificates but i doubt it'll do much, and also i think i get
            certificate for participating in OSN or national sains olympiad in
            informatics as a finalist on province level.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Like alway you can always contact me through discord or email,</p>
    </div>
</Layout>
